<Base title="Privacy policy" description="Privacy policy for AI Virtual Assistant Co: a static site with no accounts, no forms, no payments and no tracking cookies set by us." path="privacy/">
<div class="wrap read page-body"><h1>Privacy policy</h1>
<p><strong>Last updated:</strong> 20 Nov 2026</p><ul><li>This is a static website. It has no accounts, payment forms or comments, and we set no tracking or advertising cookies.</li><li>The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub may log technical data such as IP addresses; see GitHub's privacy statement.</li><li>The Request a quote page does not collect data itself. If you contact us by the method shown there, we use what you send only to answer your enquiry.</li><li>Please do not send passwords, card numbers or highly sensitive data in an enquiry.</li><li>If we add analytics, a form service or a policy on handling client material, we will update this page first.</li></ul>
</div></Base>
